{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51528","headline":"化城寺 · 罗邺","name":"化城寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庆云生处梵王宫，蹑磴攀萝一径通。\n金殿忽开青嶂里，天人疑在白云中。\n秋霄爽朗空潭月，暑气萧寥古柏风。\n况是慈悲清净地，香烟像设固无穷。\n（《九华山志》八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}